+
+Run the `independent_raw_axes` Cargo integration test. `ORACLE_REPORT=<path>` optionally writes qualification.json. Every original173case has explicit raw-selection and full-C-K standing. The latter remains unestablished. Source/line assertions cover all137raw-selected cases (105current-producer,32future-profile),142sources,287rows,147lexical reservation groups;104observations have independently recomputed exact usage extrema. Future profile projection follows the frozen selection, never feeds it. The other2future-profile cases have no selected dollar source. Missing-launch dollar evidence is additionally covered as an unresolved control; it is not assigned an invented launch identity. New controls are independently checked outside the historical173case count.
+
+Supported axes: exact raw/rate/fact hashes; source selection and source/line totality; maximum distinct well-formed reservation amounts; unique comparison applicability; provider-qualified identities and explicit declared family; billing/auxiliary field states; required counts; feasible OpenAI cache vertices; Anthropic lifetime/residual bounds; complete status200 AND successful provider terminal AND counts conjunction; error-status usage retention; malformed IDs; historical revision findings and writer arithmetic controls. Single-observation expected valuations are compared to separately recomputed raw arithmetic. Multi-observation reducer aggregation, complete correlation/transition semantics, full K findings and production gate authority remain unestablished.
