+qualification.json uses established/contradicted/unestablished standing. The assertions fail on contradictions; they do not rewrite expectations. A passing raw-axis check is not full C-K acceptance, a reference reducer, production integration, freeze approval or S2a readiness.
+
+Future gate controls consume only a separate top-level trusted_fixture_inputs mapping with an exact payload digest, authority, session, policy reference and evidence reference. Outputs say test_mock. Producer writer labels, verified:true, provenance labels and self-supplied receipt digests cannot mint this input. This tests conditional policy and payload binding only. No production verifier, cryptography, authentication channel or enforcement is implemented.
