+Writer controls preserve the historical synthetic originals. R6-C01 supplies compatible local reservation configuration (input_bound1000, output_cap150, flex0.5): (1000*12.5+150*50)*0.5/1e6=.01. Its observed-default incomplete usage supports.015 and does not release the reservation. R6-C02 supplies input_bound6000/output_cap14500/default: R=.8. The pinned parser can log a non200 response.completed payload and usage; error_status charges0 while supported usage1USD is retained. These are local writer arithmetic/branch consistency witnesses, with reachability not_established. Passing a reservation lower-bound check never proves actual producer reachability.
